# Build context hygiene — keep node_modules, build output and secrets out of
# the docker build context. Without this, `docker build` uploads the entire
# repo (including every node_modules and .next) on every build.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/e2e-results
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/__pycache__
**/.git
**/.freebuff
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
frontend/.next
backend/dist
